        "created_at": "2014-07-11T03:47:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>One fight left against the Chairman.  Random dice rolls got me Bunker, Mister Fixer, KNYFE, and Dark Watch Expatriette, though it took four fights and after the third one I just said screw it and threw him into the Freedom Tower.  Took Expatriette forever to get a gun, but she did get out Hairtrigger Reflexes, so she spent a few rounds just buffing herself and taking shots at all the punks who came into play.</p>\n<p>Looks like it’s GI Bunker, Fanatic, KNYFE again, and Setback against them in Silver Gulch.</p>",
