        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jimb/{size}/2093_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-07-11T21:14:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That number is probably quite inflated by me playing as many five-person games against the Vengeance Five as I could manage.  A more accurate number would be reflected by counting my posts in this thread.</p>\n<p>All the same, thank you for the notice.  I’m glad to have participated, and a little sorry the game ended.  It was fun while it lasted, though.</p>",
