        "id": 103453,
        "name": "JimB",
        "username": "JimB",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jimb/{size}/2093_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-07-12T01:03:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"dpt\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/48/1922_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> dpt:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It was great fun reading all of your reports, JimB!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Thank you.  Most of them aren’t very good, but there are three or four okay ones in there.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Oaktree\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/oaktree/48/2287_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Oaktree:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I am thoroughly sick of DW Setback right now.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Say that twice, brother, because I am right there with you.  Say it twice.</p>",
