        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"JimB\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jimb/48/2093_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> JimB:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>dpt wrote:</b><br><blockquote>It was great fun reading all of your reports, JimB!\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nThank you. Most of them aren't very good, but there are three or four okay ones in there.\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Oaktree wrote:</b><br><blockquote>I am thoroughly sick of DW Setback right now.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nSay that twice, brother, because I am right there with you. Say it twice.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I see that.&nbsp; You played him 15 of the 29 matches he was in.&nbsp; I did another 7.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
